"A build item that allows extension to configure the native-image compiler to effectively ignore certain configuration files in specific jars. The `jarFile` property specifies the name of the jar file or a regular expression that can be used to match multiple jar files. Matching jar files using regular expressions should be done as a last resort. The `resourceName` property specifies the name of the resource file or a regular expression that can be used to match multiple resource files. For the match to work, the resources need to be part of the matched jar file(s) (see `jarFile` ). Matching resource files using regular expressions should be done as a last resort. See https://github.com/oracle/graal/pull/3179 for more details.\n"
"--"
